# Files excluded from the archive uploaded to EAS Build.
#
# When this file exists it REPLACES .gitignore for upload purposes, so
# everything that should stay out of the archive must be listed here.
#
# node_modules is committed to this repo, which meant EAS included all
# ~43k files (150 MB archive). The build server runs its own install from
# package-lock.json, so uploading them was pure waste.

# ===================
# Dependencies — reinstalled on the build server
# ===================
node_modules/

# ===================
# Secrets — never needed inside the build archive
# ===================

# Build-time vars come from the "env" block in eas.json
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Signing credentials. Used locally by eas submit / build.js,
# never read from inside the uploaded archive.
*.p8
*.jks
*.keystore
*.der
*.pem
credentials.json

# ===================
# Local caches and tooling
# ===================
.expo/
.git/
.vscode/
.idea/
dist/
web-build/
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# ===================
# OS generated files
# ===================
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
